<title>USA: Springs Industries Q4 net shr $0.51 vs $1.30.</title>
<headline>Springs Industries Q4 net shr $0.51 vs $1.30.</headline>
<dateline>FORT MILL, S.C. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>				     Quarter Ended    Year Ended</p>
<p>			    Dec. 28, Dec. 30,   Dec. 28,   Dec. 30,</p>
